Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and I see the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was\Na child Who could only cry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him\NI fell far behind my only
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought one day I will be\Nstronger. Bridery and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind Am I\Nstronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure But until\NI do, my voyage will not end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next,\NI'm walking straight ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's all on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.26,0:01:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing. There's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,no way anything will take what I hold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,dear away from me The voices inside me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Push me to keep surviving. I'll go on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get through,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.92,0:01:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what I gotta do\NThe fiercest of the ball can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,pour upon me I don't care why\Nin the world would I turn back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go. There's nothing that\Ncan stop us now. Though time's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on our side. We'll never let it\Npull us down. And we may fall but
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll always keep on standing.\NThere's no way anything will take what
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hold dear, away from me. I know\Nthe future's there for us to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to see the war!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.72,0:02:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get it fixed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're having problems\Nwith the video transponder snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they got blown up in\Nthe crossfire or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that the Navy and Whitebeard\Nhave some kind of deal worked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Whitebeard really sell out his allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We all want to know how\Nthe war's going to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world's at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when I thought the Navy\Ncouldn't sink any lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been nothing but a sideshow till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason we came back to\NSabo Odi was to watch the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course the snail's malfunctioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really buying that? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way the Navy\Nwould allow that feed to cut out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't want the world to\Nsee what they're about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Captain Barney? Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard sold out as allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What a load of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.34,0:03:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The man's a living legend because\Nall us pirates respect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail, Beppo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You with us, Sean Berets?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, you heard me right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like there's no chance\Nof recovering the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's happening\Nat Marineford right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteor Volcano!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll melt that ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And drown them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no it's not a birdie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lama's boiling the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get on the ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.44,0:05:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They're blocking us in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to be able to\Ntake down this wall somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.01,0:05:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.14,0:05:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it still standing\Nafter a shot from Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's hit him\Nwhere it really hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard aimed\Nstraight for the Moby Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to put out the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All hands on Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab a bucket and put it out, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let her sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It just won't be the same sailing\Nwith Ace again without the Moby Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard, watch your\Nlegacy go up in flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Moby Dick, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,it's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn those monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship was the only home we knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Voby Dick has been carrying\Nthe white-bit pirates for decades!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get to the plaza\Nbefore this gets any worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is working\Nperfectly, so we'll proceed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Phase two is the immediate\Nexecution of Portgas D. Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get up there\Nand stop them, but how
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we're completely trapped no there's still
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.06,0:07:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,a way out Just look ahead and see the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:08:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,path that oars made\Nbut that's like a death
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,trap that's exactly where The Navy's\Nexpecting us to go the more we think the more
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,time we waste yeah it's The only way we\Ncan save Ace even if it means our death?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.95,0:08:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right here behind you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're running straight into\Nthe line of fire. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them get as close as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way in and one way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where else is the Navy going\Nto point their cannons?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a slaughterhouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.24,0:09:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.26,0:09:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How is little Oars still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did nobody check his pulse? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:10:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me! Ah! Oars!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will die till you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ors, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No more falling in the sea, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you're too reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to open fire, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ours, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta do something,\Nand we gotta do it fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They already issued\Nthe order to kill Lace!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but we need a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Bay, I need a favor from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.06,0:11:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just about dead. Keep shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your bullets, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We've dealt with enough setbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get this execution on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.78,0:11:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A headshot seems appropriate,\Nquick, easy, and 100 % effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Motion, power, shoulders roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.18,0:12:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So you found a way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done quite well, son of dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're standing tall now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So much fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Straw Hat Luffy who\Ngot thrown over the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I do respect your tenacity,\Nkid, but it's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:12:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.91,0:13:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Far and you're too\Ngreen to go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever gives you the\Nidea, you can defeat us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He and his brother are two of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They just dive right in\Nwithout even thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ors, stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Geoise, the trump card. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.66,0:13:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to move, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're charging straight into the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, stay. Mr. Butler!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight to Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to fight these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, trying to sneak by us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you almost made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready, men. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.92,0:15:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be advantageous\Nto have you here for the battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,since you hold a grudge\Nagainst Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd have a chance to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.06,0:16:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a short while ago, Crocodile\Nwas trying to murder Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what transpired to\Nmake him change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can kill that old dying\Nbuzzard whenever I feel like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but as for right now, I'm not\Ngoing to let you taste victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you and your crooked operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey pal do you remember me it's so\Nflamingo first you turned me down and now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.90,0:16:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you want to team up with whitebeard
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:17:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you got some nerve
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,playing me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be foolish i'm not\Nteaming up with anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.06,0:17:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way you're giving my\Nfriendship a cold shoulder!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.30,0:17:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say i appreciate that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two are distracting everybody else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Better get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.48,0:17:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.48,0:18:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not another step, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your temper tantrum ends\Nright now! Move it! Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Moon move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Smash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Control!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sakazuki said...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.88,0:19:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.72,0:19:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I still owe your grandfather a favor,\NStraw Hat, but you've left me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose to risk your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to face the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You fiend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you hurt my darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's 1st Division\Ncommander, Marco!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.36,0:19:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't mention it, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three invaders in the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're using their Devil Fruit\Npowers to go straight over the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.48,0:20:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop swearing\Nuntil you get the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get to the plaza,\Nno matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They really think they can get to us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard the gap and don't let them through!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.78,0:20:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got nothing to lose now that\Nwe've sunk the ice in their ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fire away while we\Nstill have the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.80,0:21:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab the hose and get on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's another pirate ship,\Nsir. We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,another coated pirate\Nships about to enter the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,bayonets coming fast\Nyou've got to be kidding me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it must have been hidden\Nunderwater the entire time?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.58,0:22:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We caught those puns off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said they had\Nsunk all of our ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a battle boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's heading straight\Nfor us at full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.46,0:22:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now sink that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop it like Moby Dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cease fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship is too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim your firing oars! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.44,0:22:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oars the giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.58,0:22:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody better!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.76,0:23:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He plugged the ship right out of the bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.62,0:23:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They've broken through\Nthe encircling walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.62,0:23:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it to the plaza, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.22,0:23:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.13,0:23:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace is right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.22,0:23:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's burn the headquarters down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.56,0:23:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.34,0:23:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.82,0:23:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.54,0:23:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That space could barely\Nfit one ship through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.38,0:23:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet here we are with a\Nboat full of pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.32,0:23:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The walls were supposed to trap them, but\Nthey might end up trapping us instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.72,0:23:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He just won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.12,0:23:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.52,0:23:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We got here right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.50,0:23:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit tight, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.32,0:23:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.76,0:24:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The platform!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.94,0:24:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace is on the platform!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.78,0:24:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We can -
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.88,0:24:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Snow! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.14,0:24:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Save Ace for me, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.98,0:24:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.46,0:24:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, horse, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.12,0:24:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.64,0:25:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.30,0:25:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard has entered the plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.26,0:25:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My sons, please, stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.78,0:25:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.18,0:25:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.76,0:26:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.52,0:26:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Ace to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.48,0:26:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And once you're done with\Nthat, destroy the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.10,0:26:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you with me, Garp?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.10,0:26:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.42,0:26:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear we can't hold back anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.78,0:26:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle may be our last.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.16,0:26:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
